	"data": "ProtonGraph\n\nNode-based tool for procedural content creation in Godot. Like visual scripting but for 3D model generation.\nRepo: <https://github.com/protongraph/protongraph>\nLicense: Check repo\nGodot version: Requires custom engine modules\nStatus: Listed in awesome-godot, needs custom build\n\nWhat It Provides\nNode-based visual editor for procedural generation\nNodes represent operations (noise, blend, transform, etc.)\nGraph structure defines the generation pipeline\nOutput is 3D content\n\nRelevance…",
